{
  "meta": {
    "title": "Asma ul Husna — The Beautiful Names of Allah",
    "disclosure": "The Prophet ﷺ said that Allah has ninety-nine names (Sahih al-Bukhari 2736; Sahih Muslim 2677). Scholars differ on the exact list: the enumerations in circulation, including the one in Jami' at-Tirmidhi, are regarded by many hadith scholars as a later compilation rather than the words of the Prophet ﷺ. This page uses the commonly published list of 99 names. Translations here are drafts awaiting human review.",
    "review_status": "REQUIRES REVIEW",
    "review_notes": [
      "Name 65 (Al-Majid / Al-Maajid): shares its transliteration with Name 48; list-membership and exact form vary between lists.",
      "Names 66-68 (Al-Wahid, Al-Ahad, As-Samad): lists differ on which of these are included; confirm against the intended list.",
      "Name 77 (Al-Wali): list-membership uncertain; the Quran uses 'waliyy' (Name 55).",
      "Name 28 (Al-Hakam): Quran has 'hakam' only indirectly (6:114); no ref given.",
      "Name 29 (Al-'Adl): Quran uses 'adl' as a noun, not clearly as a divine name; no ref given.",
      "Name 60 (Al-Muhyi): Quran has 'muhyi al-mawta' in construct form (30:50, 41:39); confirm it counts.",
      "Names 20-25, 41, 49, 57-59, 61, 64, 71-72, 81, 86, 89-92, 96-99: not found in this exact form in the Quran; refs empty. Spelling and list-membership vary between enumerations.",
      "Names 84 and 85 (Malik-ul-Mulk, Dhul-Jalali wal-Ikram): compound names; refs verified by presence of both words.",
      "Names 39, 40, 43, 52, 70, 82, 83, 94 (e.g. Al-Muqit, Al-Hasib, Ar-Raqib, Al-Hadi): cited ayat use indefinite/accusative forms; matched by text only.",
      "Refs for Al-Hakim, Al-Karim, Al-Qawiyy, Al-'Alim, Ar-Rahim and similar were matched on text form; reviewer should confirm each cited ayah refers to Allah.",
      "Name 78 (Al-Muta'ali): Quran spelling in 13:9 is 'al-muta'al' (final ya dropped); Arabic given in the standard form.",
      "Roman Urdu and explanations are drafts for all names; Names 20-25, 49, 57-61, 71-72, 89-92 are paired/opposite names needing careful human review of wording."
    ]
  },
